<!--
  SITEMAP INACTIVE. Read before enabling.

  Deliberately deactivated, for two independent reasons:

    1. The site runs as a hash-routed single-page app. Every route is served the
       same document (dist/index.html) and the view is selected by the URL
       fragment. A fragment is never sent to the server, so there is exactly one
       indexable URL, not one per page. A sitemap of per-route entries would be a
       list of URLs that all resolve to the same page.

    2. No production domain is confirmed. The official domain below is a
       placeholder and must not be published. A sitemap naming an invented host
       is worse than no sitemap at all.

  The application now adopts a clean path into the fragment on entry, so
  https://OFFICIAL_DOMAIN/programmes does render the catalogue. The response is
  still this single document, so it remains one indexable URL. Publishing real
  per-route entries therefore requires genuinely per-route documents, such as a
  static export or server-side rendering. A routing change alone will not do it.

  While this file is empty, index.html declares a single root canonical and a
  root og:url for exactly the same reason. Do not add a "Sitemap:" line to
  robots.txt until this file contains real entries.

  NOTE ON A REMOVED LIST
  An earlier version of this comment suggested slugs including "mba",
  "doctorate-business-administration" and "undergraduate-business". Those were
  aspirational placeholders that do not exist in the catalogue and that
  misrepresent GIBS as a degree-awarding institution. GIBS publishes executive
  training programmes only. It does not offer academic admissions and it does not
  award degrees. They have been removed deliberately; do not reintroduce them.

  XML NOTE
  A run of two consecutive hyphens is not permitted anywhere inside an XML
  comment, and including one makes the entire file malformed, which is why this
  comment uses plain text separators instead of dashed rules. This was the cause
  of a real defect: an earlier revision of this file was not well-formed XML.
-->
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
</urlset>